{"company_id":"inventoryquant-com","company_name":"InventoryQuant","website":"https://www.inventoryquant.com","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_77f8ba9de8e9","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/inventoryquant","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"We automate the inventory process in insurance\nIndustries: AI, B2B, Insurance\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 1\n{\"slug\": \"inventoryquant\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 1, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": false, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31197\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:24.127189Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_1a239b88ef62","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"InventoryQuant InventoryQuant How It Works Testimonials Resources Dashboard Get Started Sign In Y Backed by Y Combinator Automate your inventory processing in minutes Transcribe audio and video inventories, find replacement prices, and generate reports — all automatically. Save days of manual work per claim. Try for Free Book a Demo 10x Faster processing 100+ Languages supported Days Saved per claim 99% Transcription accuracy Do you find yourself spending hours... There is an easier way. Manually transcribing line items for hours? Endlessly searching replacement prices online? Overwhelmed by growing claim volumes? How It Works Four steps to reclaim your time 01 Take an Inventory Record a video or audio walkthrough of the loss site. Speak naturally — we handle background noise, multiple speakers, and self-corrections. You can even use smart glasses! 02 Upload Files InventoryQuant transcribes every line item into clean spreadsheet format, automatically parsing descriptions, quantities, and measurements. 03 Price Items InventoryQuant finds replacement items and prices from major retailers, matching descriptions to real products automatically. 04 Export Generate XactContents or PDF reports ready to submit. All data, photos, and pricing included — no manual formatting needed. See It In Action Try it yourself 0:00 / 0:00 Your browser does not support the audio element. Select a file Regular Audio Noisy Background Multiple Speakers Self-Corrections Download Spreadsheet Download Audio Location: Living Room Line # Description Qty Code Link Images Replacement Price 1 Reclining three cushion leather couch 1 SF Wayfair $1,000.00 2 Throw pillow 2 SF Target $25.00 3 Wooden coffee table, 4 ft x 2 ft 1 HF Wayfair $169.00 4 Wooden end table, 2 ft x 2 ft x 3 ft 2 HF Walmart $17.23 5 Wooden media console, 6 ft x 3 ft 1 HF Ashley Furniture $599.99 6 Flat screen TV, 75 inches 1 AV Best Buy $599.99 Try for Free “” “ InventoryQuant has been running smoothly at GGG for the last two months and has already saved us entire days worth of time . Just as important, Sander and his team have been reacting in real time to our notes and suggestions as the product is being refined and tailored for public adjuster use.” Neil C. Kahn CFO & General Counsel, Goodman-Gable-Gould FAQ Frequently asked questions Can InventoryQuant handle background noise? Can I take an inventory in Spanish? Can InventoryQuant handle multiple speakers? Can InventoryQuant assign photos to each line item? Can it handle mistakes or self-corrections? Ready to save days on every claim? Join the adjusters and firms already automating their inventory process with InventoryQuant. Start Free Trial InventoryQuant © 2026 InventoryQuant. All rights reserved.","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/inventoryquant-com/26837b6a59ee0e53.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:24.359970Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_2da3ca1edd20","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com/user-manual","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"**InventoryQuant (IQ)** is an interactive web-application platform that can automatically transcribe and price an audio file upload or price an existing inventory spreadsheet list, exporting the results in a spreadsheet format. * **User:** The individual that uses IQ and uploads files to be transcribed and/or priced. * **Dashboard:** The functioning, operative page where a user selects and uploads a file, where processed files are downloaded, and the user can review specific processed flies and their processed files history. * **Upload Button:** The button located below the Select a File Box that the user clicks to upload and process the selected file. * **Processing a File:** The automatic operation that occurs after the user clicks the upload button after uploading a file. * **Downloaded Processed File:** The output produced after IQ processes the selected/uploaded file. * **See Full Inventory Button:** The button the user clicks on to view the inventory list (priced or unpriced) on the See Full Inventory page. If pricing is included in the processed file output, the user can also select different prices for the individual line items or use the price adjuster tool, located to the right of the price total, to adjust all of the prices together. * If the Spreadsheet Upload is selected, this means you would like to have an existing spreadsheet list of items priced. * Once you have selected your file to be processed, and you have selected a pricing option (if applicable), the upload button will change color to inform you that you're file is ready to be uploaded. Then, click on the Upload button to begin processing your selected file. * Then, IQ will indicate below the Upload button that your file is being processed. * The processing time for a large audio file and spreadsheet file with 1500+ line items can take up to **30 minutes**. * The above instructions for the**Full Inventory Page** (*Transcribe and Price*) are the same as for the **Full Inventory Page** (*Transcribe Only*) except there is no option to review or change prices or web links as these are not included in this file processing selection.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:29.156504Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"InventoryQuant site:inventoryquant.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_a30b72a3af6b","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://inventoryquant.com","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"PricingResourcesDashboard🧠 Get your inventory IQ score. # Streamline Your Inventory Process. Automatically transcribe and price audio and video inventories. > \"**InventoryQuant** has been running smoothly at GGG for the last two months and has already saved us entire days worth of time. Just as important, Sander and his team have been reacting in real time to our notes and suggestions as the product is being refined and tailored for public adjuster use.\". ## Reclaim your time. ### Take an Inventory. Take a video or audio inventory of the loss. ### Upload Files. InventoryQuant transcribes all line items into spreadsheet format. ### Price Items. InventoryQuant finds replacement items and prices. ### Export. InventoryQuant generates XactContents or PDF reports, ready to send. ## Try it Yourself. ## What's your Inventory IQ? Take our quick 6-question assessment to discover how efficient your inventory process is. ### Quick Assessment. 6 questions, less than 3 minutes. Get score and analysis immediately. ### Personalized Tips. ## Frequently asked questions... ### Can InventoryQuant handle background noise? Yes, InventoryQuant can handle almost any level of background noise, including sound generated from moving equipment, construction noises, and other speakers. InventoryQuant can even handle audio from people speaking through masks. ### Can I take an inventory in Spanish? Yes, InventoryQuant can handle inventories in over 100 languages! This includes Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, and many others! ### Can InventoryQuant handle multiple speakers? Yes, many inventory teams have one person describe items, and another call out measurements. InventoryQuant can differentiate between the speakers, and can even filter out unrelated conversations they may have (e.g. ### Can InventoryQuant assign photos to each line item? Yes, if you upload a video, we extract one or more frames for each line item. This information is also added to the XactContents and PDF exports. ### Can InventoryQuant handle mistakes or corrections? Yes, one of InventoryQuant's best features is handling mistakes and self-corrections! Try out some complex mistakes and corrections. ### How can I work with my team? InventoryQuant allows you to share files with your team members. You can edit files simultaneously and see your teammates' edits coming in just like a Google Doc.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:29.156558Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"InventoryQuant site:inventoryquant.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_b2ee44e99ea6","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com?fp=aDs7OjspF2s+GqrpEUoWYgsQ40SLBh+t0+81+%2FSSyzB%2FI0jEnSMorE0lMGHKA+oVQBoYfypA1UHBKuimlqV8pQ%3D%3D&prvtof=CXyvEHzrkc9cmS2+B5VlpWlugmpxXy80IPg7kvgLy3g%3D&poru=PuoWMx1i6CJBUiJSgP11+F3bjWC3iZa5qCTAV0I%2ForZFzDIeg5Si3qdA2oLJSEcx","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"Pricing Tips User Manual Dashboard 🧠 Get your inventory IQ score. # *Streamline* your Inventory Process. **InventoryQuant** automatically transcribes voice memos and prices items from an audio recording or a spreadsheet, exporting the results to an Excel file. > \"InventoryQuant has been running smoothly at GGG for the last two months and has already saved us entire days worth of time. Hours spent on manual transcription. Endless searching for product prices. ### Record Inventories. Make an audio recording of the inventory take-off in MP3 or WMA format. InventoryQuant transcribes them to text within minutes. ### Price Lookup. InventoryQuant finds current market values for items. InventoryQuant compiles the item and pricing information into a professional report, downloadable as an Excel file. Clear audio recording in a quiet environment. Note: The links provided in the table are screenshots as prices are subject to change. ## InventoryQuant Features. Discover how InventoryQuant can transform your Inventory Takeoff process. ### Automatic Audio Transcription. Convert recorded conversations and notes into text format instantly, saving hours of manual work. ### Product Pricing Lookup. Access up-to-date pricing information for a wide range of products with just a few clicks. ### Time-Saving Efficiency. Reduce manual transcription and research time by up to 90%, allowing you to focus on client service. Ensure precise documentation and assessments with our advanced transcription and pricing tools. ## Ready to Transform Your Inventory Process? ## What's your inventory IQ? Take our quick 6-question assessment to discover how efficient your current inventory process really is. Get personalized insights and see where you can improve. ### How does InventoryQuant handle audio with background noise? Our advanced AI algorithms are trained to filter out background noise, ensuring accurate transcription even in noisy environments like busy streets or crowded rooms. ### Can InventoryQuant transcribe conversations with multiple speakers? Yes, InventoryQuant can differentiate between multiple speakers in a conversation, providing clear and organized transcriptions that attribute dialogue to the correct individuals. ### How does InventoryQuant handle self-corrections or mistakes in speech? It can understand context and adjust the transcription accordingly, ensuring the final output reflects the speaker's intended message.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:29.156587Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"InventoryQuant site:inventoryquant.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_b78841439c1a","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com/pricing","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"PricingResourcesDashboard🧠 Get your inventory IQ score. # Simple, transparent pricing. Only pay for what you use. ## Free Plan. Perfect for testing out InventoryQuant. * Up to 100 items per file. ## Pro Plan. For businesses ready to scale. $0.065 /priced line item. $0.015 /transcribed line item. * Audio lengths up to 100 minutes. ## Frequently Asked Questions. ### How does the free trial work? You can use all features of InventoryQuant for up to 10 audio files and 5 spreadsheet files, with a limit of 100 items per file. ### Can I upgrade or downgrade at any time? Yes, you can upgrade to Pro at any time. When downgrading, you will immediately lose Pro access and will be billed for any usage at the end of your current billing period. ### What payment methods do you accept? We accept all major credit cards, including Visa, Mastercard, and American Express. We also support payment via PayPal. ### Is there a long-term contract? No, our Pro plan is billed monthly and you can cancel at any time. However, you will be billed for previous usage. There are no long-term commitments required.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:29.156612Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"InventoryQuant site:inventoryquant.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_b1ac1443d0f3","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com/resources","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"Title: InventoryQuant\n# Up your Inventory Game. How to Take the Best Inventory: Fast, Accurate, and Insurance‑Ready. ## How to Take the Best Inventory: Fast, Accurate, and Insurance‑Ready. Learn the proven techniques for creating thorough, accurate inventories that stand up to insurance scrutiny. ## Introducing Video Inventories. Discover how video-based inventories are revolutionizing the claims process with faster, more detailed documentation. A comprehensive guide to effectively utilizing InventoryQuant—from your first upload to downloading a polished inventory. Best Practices for Audio Recording. ## Best Practices for Audio Recording. ## Claim Workspace. Master the Full Inventory Page to review, edit, and perfect your inventory before export. Learn how to set up your team, invite members, and manage permissions in InventoryQuant. **InventoryQuant (IQ)** is an interactive web-application platform that can automatically transcribe and price an audio file or video, price an existing inventory spreadsheet list, and generate descriptions for images, exporting the results in a spreadsheet or PDF format. Image of what the dashboard looks like. Image of the select a file box. Image of what the inventory page looks like. Image of the back to dashboard button. #### Step 1: Signing/Logging In. Image of how to get to the login page. Click **Sign In** or **Get Started**. Image of what the sign in page looks like. #### Step 2: Account Creation/Email Verification (only needs to be done once). Image of the create an account button. Image of the verification email sent. After creating an account, a verification email will be sent to the email address you used to create the account. Image of the email verification. Click the **Verify Email Address** button in the email you received. Image of the email verified. Clicking the verify button will direct you to this page. Click the **Continue to dashboard** button to access the **Dashboard**. #### Step 3: Creating a New Claim. dashboard page right after creating a new claim. Claim Workspace right after creating a new claim. Image of the select a file box. Image of the spreadsheet template. #### Step 5: Claim Workspace. Image of what the Claim Workspace looks like. ##### What You Can Do On The Inventory Tab. Image of the sign out button.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:29.156633Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"InventoryQuant site:inventoryquant.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_e10271a42915","company_id":"inventoryquant-com","source_type":"fallback_page","url":"https://www.inventoryquant.com/","title":"InventoryQuant","text_snippet":"InventoryQuant InventoryQuant How It Works Testimonials Resources Dashboard Get Started Sign In Y Backed by Y Combinator Automate your inventory processing in minutes Transcribe audio and video inventories, find replacement prices, and generate reports — all automatically. Save days of manual work per claim. Try for Free Book a Demo 10x Faster processing 100+ Languages supported Days Saved per claim 99% Transcription accuracy Do you find yourself spending hours... There is an easier way. Manually transcribing line items for hours? Endlessly searching replacement prices online? Overwhelmed by growing claim volumes? How It Works Four steps to reclaim your time 01 Take an Inventory Record a video or audio walkthrough of the loss site. Speak naturally — we handle background noise, multiple speakers, and self-corrections. You can even use smart glasses! 02 Upload Files InventoryQuant transcribes every line item into clean spreadsheet format, automatically parsing descriptions, quantities, and measurements. 03 Price Items InventoryQuant finds replacement items and prices from major retailers, matching descriptions to real products automatically. 04 Export Generate XactContents or PDF reports ready to submit. All data, photos, and pricing included — no manual formatting needed. See It In Action Try it yourself 0:00 / 0:00 Your browser does not support the audio element. Select a file Reg