{"company_id":"ventura-ai","company_name":"Ventura","website":"https://www.ventura.ai","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_c5a4f63bc9fc","company_id":"ventura-ai","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/ventura","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"AI Workforce for Distributors and Manufacturers\nIndustries: Industrials\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 2\n{\"slug\": \"ventura\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 2, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": true, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31156\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:56.430218Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_0136f7e079fc","company_id":"ventura-ai","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://ventura.ai/","title":"Ventura | AI quoting and order entry for distributors","text_snippet":"Ventura | AI quoting and order entry for distributors Get in touch Reps should be selling, not entering data. Ventura automates the manual work behind every quote and order so your reps can focus on what actually drives revenue. Get started The Problem Half your team's day disappears into back-office work. Every quote, every order, every customer inquiry requires a rep to dig through emails, search the ERP, cross-check quotes, and type information manually into your systems. That is not selling. That is data entry. And it is eating the majority of your team's day. 2–3 hours per rep per day on lookup, copy-paste, and re-entry Quotes that take hours instead of minutes, losing deals to faster competitors Leads go cold while reps are stuck in the ERP Animated workflow connectors EMAIL PO CALL ERP CRM The Solution Automation built for your workflow Start with one capability or deploy the complete platform. Everything connects to your existing systems. Ventura logo icon QUO-78432 $284,342.57 Valid for 30 days To From Address Quoting Generate accurate quotes instantly. Ventura reads incoming requests, matches products from your catalog, and creates professional quotes without manual lookup. PO-2024-00891 Purchase Order Item Qty 200 50 120 10 75 30 Order Entry Turn purchase orders into ERP entries automatically. Ventura extracts line items, resolves part numbers, and pushes clean orders directly to your system. Win Rate by Segment Last 90 days 68% Won 32% Lost Commercial (42%) Residential (26%) Sales Intelligence Understand what your customers buy, when they buy, and what they are likely to need next. Ventura surfaces insights your reps can act on today. Customer Hi, I'd like to order 200 units of SKU-4421. Representative Got it, SKU-4421 at $12.40/unit. Shall I create a quote for 200 units? Phone Agent Ventura joins your rep's calls as a silent note-taker, transcribes the conversation, and automatically creates the resulting quote or order directly in your ERP. No manual entry. The Impact Real results for your team Ventura delivers measurable improvements across productivity, revenue, and accuracy from day one. 3x Productivity gains It's like tripling your rep headcount without the hiring cost. Your reps have more time for actual selling and serving customers. AI handles 95%+ automatically. Your team simply audits and approves. +3-5% Higher win rate Increase quote-to-order conversion by responding faster and improving customer service. 35% of deals go to whoever responds first. 25% Reduced errors Fewer returns and re-deliveries caused by mistyped units of measure, wrong items, or incorrect quantities. 1–4% of manually entered orders contain an error. Decorative background shape Why Ventura A different kind of platform Most automation tools need months of setup and break the moment a format changes. Ventura is built to understand, not to match. 01 Any format. No templates. Ventura reads what your customers actually send: emails, images, and phone calls. No setup templates or field mapping required. Most teams are live within days. Email Images Phone calls 02 Follows your procedures, exactly. Define the exact steps you want followed and Ventura executes them on every task, consistently. From cross-referencing quotes in your CRM to applying freight charge rules, your procedures become the default. 03 Secure by design. Ventura is SOC 2 Type II compliant. Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest, never used to train shared models, and processed under strict access controls. Bring AI into your sales workflow with confidence. 04 Gets better every day. Whenever your team gives feedback on an output, Ventura learns instantly. No retraining, no waiting. The more you use it, the sharper it gets. Decorative background shape Process How It Works A request comes in. Ventura handles it. Your rep approves. 1 Read Request, Match Products Ventura understands emails and other formats and smartly matches products against your catalog. 2 Add a comment... SKU-4421 · 200 units matched and ready to approve. Review & Approve Your rep reviews the AI's output, makes any corrections, and approves. Every edit trains the model to get smarter. 3 ERP Push to ERP Instantly An accurate quote or order is ready in your ERP in minutes Integrations One platform that works with every system you run. Ventura connects directly to your ERP, CRM, email inbox, phone system. Pull live inventory and customer-specific pricing in real time. Decorative background shape FAQ Frequently Asked Questions Everything you need to know about getting started with Ventura. What types of companies use Ventura? How does Ventura connect to my existing systems? How reliable is the AI matching? What about exceptions or complex scenarios? How quickly can we get started? Still have questions? Get in touch with our team Contact See what your team could get back. Get in touch and we'll walk you through what Ventura looks like for your specific setup. Dedicated account manager Custom integrations Talk to our team Fill out the form and we'll be in touch within 24 hours. Request a demo By submitting, you agree to our Privacy Policy . AI Quoting and Order Entry for Distributors and Manufacturers. Product Features How It Works Integrations FAQs Company Contact Privacy Policy Connect Email icon LinkedIn icon © 2026 Gradient Ascent Labs, Inc. All rights reserved.","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/ventura-ai/7ce7a39f25f41c21.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:01:56.795824Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_7065ebf55f4e","company_id":"ventura-ai","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://ventura.ai/","title":"Ventura | AI quoting and order entry for distributors","text_snippet":"Ventura automates the manual work behind every quote and order so your reps can focus on what actually drives revenue. Every quote, every order, every customer inquiry requires a rep to dig through emails, search the ERP, cross-check quotes, and type information manually into your systems. Ventura reads incoming requests, matches products from your catalog, and creates professional quotes without manual lookup. Ventura joins your rep's calls as a silent note-taker, transcribes the conversation, and automatically creates the resulting quote or order directly in your ERP. Increase quote-to-order conversion by responding faster and improving customer service. Ventura reads what your customers actually send: emails, images, and phone calls. Whenever your team gives feedback on an output, Ventura learns instantly. Ventura understands emails and other formats and smartly matches products against your catalog. An accurate quote or order is ready in your ERP in minutes. Ventura connects directly to your ERP, CRM, email inbox, phone system. # See what your team could get back.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:00.529586Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Ventura