{"company_id":"buildwithglue-com","company_name":"Glue","website":"https://buildwithglue.com","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_5523db1a0127","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/glue","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"The Interface Design Canvas for AI agents\nIndustries: B2B, Design Tools, Developer Tools, Engineering, Product and Design\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 2\n{\"slug\": \"glue\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 2, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": false, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31231\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:09.330208Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_82c1b943dca6","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://www.buildwithglue.com/","title":"Glue Bottle — Typographic ASCII Art","text_snippet":"Glue Bottle — Typographic ASCII Art Book a Demo Backed by Y Combinator Design & Code, In Sync. Glue lets you collaborate with your agent on a single design space backed by code, so nothing gets out of sync. Download for Mac Book a Demo Loading...","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/buildwithglue-com/2772934247322e5e.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:09.557721Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_24cbbaae228a","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://buildwithglue.com","title":"Glue - Design UI Faster with Coding Agents","text_snippet":"# Build frontend 10x faster. The visual layer for building UI with coding agents. Your coding agent picks it up and makes the change — no back-and-forth needed. ## See a component you like? Browse any site, click a component, and Glue sticks it into your codebase — adapted to your stack automatically. Run a single command in your repo and Glue handles the rest. Ready.Runglue run --to start. ### Grab components from existing sites. Browse any site, grab a component you like, and Glue sticks it into your codebase — adapted to your stack. ✂ Stick to my-app/components/Pricing.tsx. ### Show your agent exactly what to change. Click any element, leave a comment, and your agent knows precisely what to edit — no more describing components in chat. → Agent picked up · editing Button.tsx. ### Works with any coding agent. Glue is the interface layer — it works with all of them. ## Ready to build faster?","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:13.609594Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Glue site:buildwithglue.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_c5e3175ab3ce","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"fallback_page","url":"https://buildwithglue.com","title":"Glue Bottle — Typographic ASCII Art","text_snippet":"Glue Bottle — Typographic ASCII Art Book a Demo Backed by Y Combinator Design & Code, In Sync. Glue lets you collaborate with your agent on a single design space backed by code, so nothing gets out of sync. Download for Mac Book a Demo Loading...","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/buildwithglue-com/2772934247322e5e.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:13.628421Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"search_query":"Glue site:buildwithglue.com hiring","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_9f73f088e957","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/aegiron/86d6e3e5-35db-4a44-b954-ee5070ae6b33","title":"Founding Software Engineer @ Aegiron Infrastructure Solutions UG","text_snippet":"The glue: The integration surface between CV models, sensor drivers, and the operator app. When something breaks at 2am, you can tell whether it's the model","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:14.793264Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Glue site:ashbyhq.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_5b8cf6333c75","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/serverobotics/ceac06bb-47b8-44ee-bd53-0e436fd27911","title":"Staff Systems Engineer @ Serve Robotics - Jobs","text_snippet":"You will serve as the glue of the organization, working across many teams and disciplines to help orchestrate the development of a complex system by breaking","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:14.793317Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Glue site:ashbyhq.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_7128f0608474","company_id":"buildwithglue-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/duvo/4eaf5dd3-8479-4f5e-8fc4-5cdc919441af","title":"Forward Deployed Engineer (US Based) @ Duvo Inc","text_snippet":"Remote-first based in the US. Occasional travel to Europe and to customer sites across the US. You sit at the front line, map their workflows on the Duvo platform, improve the underlying processes, and turn the result into running agents that deliver tangible business impact. You own the customer outcome end to end and you own the relationship that goes with it. You will write the glue: integration scripts, agent configurations, data transformations, prototypes, whatever it takes to get an agent running against a customer's actual systems. * Build and own the working relationship with customer stakeholders, from operators to sponsors. * Make AI real for the customer. * Process improvements you drove are visible in the customer's day-to-day, not just in the agent. What matters most is that you can pick up a new business quickly, see how to improve it, and build something with AI that actually works.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:02:14.793345Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Glue site:ashbyhq.com","search_provider":"tavil