{"company_id":"helloeos-ai","company_name":"Eos AI","website":"https://www.helloeos.ai","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_7467fe38ff3b","company_id":"helloeos-ai","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/eos-ai","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"Autonomous OS for healthcare\nIndustries: Healthcare\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 1\n{\"slug\": \"eos-ai\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 2, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": false, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31058\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:03:41.020454Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_abc6004145d3","company_id":"helloeos-ai","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://www.helloeos.ai","title":"Eos AI — Harmonize Healthcare Data. Accelerate Discovery.","text_snippet":"Eos AI — Harmonize Healthcare Data. Accelerate Discovery. Eos AI Sign in The Autonomous Operating System for Healthcare 3x administrative productivity • 37% revenue recovery in early deployments • Deploy models that actually work Book a demo Unify silos Harmonize data Predictive models Automations Unify silos Reconstruct operational and clinical data across systems and time Healthcare data lives in disconnected systems: EHRs, imaging archives, labs, scheduling, and billing, each using different identifiers and maintaining its own partial record. Eos connects to these interfaces, resolves identities across sites and encounters, and links records into a continuous longitudinal history. The data itself stays in its original systems, but we can search and analyze distributed data as if it were one database. Harmonize data Make cases comparable Clinical events are recorded differently across hospitals, scanners, and documentation styles. Without normalization, historical cases cannot be reliably compared. Eos standardizes codes, imaging metadata, measurements, and documentation patterns into consistent patient trajectories, effectively acting as a translation layer between clinical applications. VERA: Imaging Harmonization Bring all modalities of medical imaging under a single standardized protocol. Aligns imaging distributions across sites, scanners, and protocols Automates cleaning and preprocessing for downstream models Improves model performance by up to 18% and shortens deployment from months to days LUCIA: Textual Harmonization Structures EHRs from any system into a unified representation. Normalizes free text, ICD, SNOMED, and clinical signals (labs, diagnoses, procedures) Learns across health systems without site-specific rules Enables consistent downstream analytics and modeling, code generation, and search Predictive models Learn from similar patients and workflows Instead of treating the visit or document as an isolated instance, Eos looks at the patient's full history and compares it to thousands of similar patients over time. It predicts how a case will resolve, triggers the required approvals and actions, and does so while reducing staff workload and recovering hospital revenue. The system models the full course of care rather than a single visit or document. Automations Inform workflows from predictions Eos integrates insights into hospital workflows and initiates the required actions automatically. Staff receive prompts, follow-ups, and coordination tasks so issues are addressed while the patient encounter is still active. This allows administrators and physicians to intervene early and the hospital to save staff hours, and recover revenue. Built and Backed By Get in touch with us. [email protected] Eos AI © Eos AI 2026","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/helloeos-ai/56742517048287ef.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:03:41.226992Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_f72e77