{"company_id":"tepali-com","company_name":"Tepali","website":"https://tepali.com","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_fd0016f10db6","company_id":"tepali-com","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/tepali","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"AI-native operating system for aesthetics & wellness\nIndustries: B2B\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 2\n{\"slug\": \"tepali\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 2, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"New York City, NY, USA\", \"isHiring\": false, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31127\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:04:09.881758Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_35220e45cc61","company_id":"tepali-com","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://www.tepali.com/","title":"Tepali | All-in-One Medspa Software","text_snippet":"Tepali | All-in-One Medspa Software tepali Get Early Access Backed by Combinator AI-native operating system for aesthetics & wellness Marketing intelligence, scheduling, team management, patient CRM, charting, and inventory. All in one platform. Request a Demo Everything You Need One platform. Zero duct tape. Replace your patchwork of tools with a single system built from the ground up for aesthetics & wellness. Point of Sale Integrated payments, invoicing, and checkout built for medspa workflows. Process transactions, manage memberships, and track revenue — all in one place. CRM / EMR Patient records, treatment history, consent management, and digital charting unified in one system. Every patient's journey from first click to VIP member. Marketing Connect ad spend to patient lifetime value automatically. Track ROI by campaign across Meta and Google, with AI recommendations on what to scale or cut. Scheduling Provider-aware booking that matches treatments to qualified staff. Employee and appointment scheduling with online self-booking and automated reminders. Inventory Real-time stock levels for injectables, devices, and consumables. Automatic reorder alerts, expiry tracking, and vendor management in one view. Payroll Provider scheduling, shift management, time tracking, and payroll processing unified. No more syncing between separate platforms to figure out who's working where. Built-in AI Assistant An AI that knows your entire medspa business Tepali's AI sits on top of your entire operation — marketing, scheduling, patients, payments — and answers any question about your business in seconds. Marketing Intelligence Which campaigns should I scale? What's my cost per acquisition on the IV drip ad? Analyzes spend, lead flow, and patient LTV across every channel. Scheduling & Operations Who's available for Botox next Tuesday? Why did we have 6 no-shows last week? Understands provider schedules, appointment patterns, and bottlenecks. Patient & Revenue Insights Which patients are due for re-treatment? What's our membership retention rate this quarter? Tracks patient journeys, flags churn risks, and spots upsell opportunities. Tepali Assistant Online Which of our campaigns should I scale up this month? Your Google Ads \"Spring Botox Special\" has the best ROI at 4.2x — $18,400 revenue from $4,380 spend. I'd pull budget from Facebook retargeting — it's only converting at 0.8x with a $210 cost-per-booking vs $49 on Google. Got it. Can we handle more Botox volume next week? Who's available? NP Sarah is your only injectable provider and she's scheduled Monday, Wednesday, Friday next week. You have 6 open Botox slots across those days. If you want to scale the campaign, I'd recommend adding Tuesday — Sarah has no conflicts and that would open 4 more slots. Want me to update her schedule and adjust the online booking availability? Ask Tepali anything... AI Agents Let AI handle the busywork Tepali agents work around the clock so your team can focus on patients. Front Desk Agent Never miss a call again Answers every phone call, 24/7. Books appointments, answers patient questions, and routes urgent matters to your team — so no revenue slips through the cracks. Front Desk Agent Handling calls SM Sarah Mitchell Booked Botox — Tue 2:30 PM Booked JL James Liu Pricing inquiry — IV Drip packages Answered RP Rachel Park Post-treatment concern — flagged urgent Routed Scribe Agent Documentation that writes itself Creates patient documentation in real time. Generates SOAP notes, treatment summaries, and consent forms — so providers stay with patients, not paperwork. Scribe Agent Generating notes SOAP Note — Sarah Mitchell Subjective: Patient presents for scheduled Botox treatment. Reports satisfaction with previous results. No adverse reactions noted. Treatment Summary Procedure: Botox 24 units — glabella (12u), forehead (8u), crow's feet (4u) Provider: NP Sarah · Room 1 Next visit: 12 weeks Consent Status: Signed digitally at 2:28 PM Marketing Agent Turn every inquiry into a booking Converts inbound leads into booked patients. Responds instantly to inquiries, nurtures prospects with follow-ups, and drives bookings while you sleep. Marketing Agent Converting leads IG Emily Chen DM replied → Sent booking link 12s ago Web David Martinez Form submitted → Follow-up SMS sent 3m ago FB Lisa Thompson Ad click → Nurture sequence started 8m ago Ready to Modernize? Your practice deserves software built for 2026, not 2006 Join the waitlist and get early access to the platform that's redefining medspa operations. Get Early Access tepali","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/tepali-com/b3c29cb695f204bc.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:04:10.174802Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_0c435b579183","company_id":"tepali-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://www.tepali.com/","title":"Tepali | All-in-One Medspa Software","text_snippet":"Tepali's AI sits on top of your entire operation — 