{"company_id":"onerobot-io","company_name":"One Robot","website":"https://www.onerobot.io","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_e03fa15ca012","company_id":"onerobot-io","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/one-robot","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"World models for robot evals and training.\nIndustries: Industrials, Manufacturing and Robotics\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 2\n{\"slug\": \"one-robot\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 2, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": true, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31081\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:05:37.450988Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_058c77afba0c","company_id":"onerobot-io","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://www.onerobot.io","title":"one robot — world models for robots","text_snippet":"one robot — world models for robots World models for robots We're One Robot. We build simulation environments that are realistic to see and realistic to interact with. Physical robot availability limits how fast teams can iterate on training. Our world models let you run more experiments, test more edge cases, and ship reliable policies faster. How it works 01 Train a world model on your data. We learn physics and visuals from your robot's experience. 02 Find where policies fail. Roll out your policy in simulation to discover edge cases before deployment. 03 Generate targeted training data. Create synthetic trajectories to fix the failures you found. See it in action Here's a 60 second autoregressive rollout of our world model, rendering the camera stream from a single wrist camera conditioned on controller actions. Built for hard manipulation Our world models handle tasks where physics matters most: contact-rich manipulation, deformable objects, and precise assembly. If your robot needs to interact with the real world, we can simulate it. Let's work together If you're building action models for manipulators, we'll fast-track your path to production. Email us at founders@onerobot.io . Team Hemanth Sarabu Previously Google, Industrial Next (YC W22), NASA JPL, McLaren Elton Shon Previously Tesla, Industrial Next (YC W22) © 2026 one robot","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/onerobot-io/ec9022078dd3e1d5.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:05:37.587350Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_ac2c6c33a89a","company_id":"onerobot-io","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/breaker/bbcb5aef-0fa0-426d-9cc8-ad71a2ed75a8","title":"Robotic Software Engineer @ Breaker - Jobs","text_snippet":"One operator per robot. One pilot per mission. Breaker's AI agent breaks this constraint. Our technology turns any robot into a truly autonomous, self","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:05:42.746046Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"One Robot site:ashbyhq.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_4e0dc6bf6e96","company_id":"onerobot-io","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/standardbots/cf8da593-22ef-42f4-9220-9294a08d9ea7","title":"Sustaining Engineer @ Standard Bots - Jobs","text_snippet":"Our AI-powered platform enables robots to tackle unprecedented challenges through an intuitive instruction interface, bringing the power of software automation","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:05:42.746159Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"One Robot site:ashbyhq.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_772e0f0fe142","company_id":"onerobot-io","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/Maticrobots/20bce7b2-43f2-47d5-b5e3-332d77ae592d","title":"Robotics Production Associate @ Matic - Jobs","text_snippet":"We believe in a similar progression for home robot