{"company_id":"docurahealth-com","company_name":"Docura Health","website":"https://docurahealth.com","source":"yc","items":[{"id":"ev_4a24debaa2e7","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"seed_metadata","url":"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/docura-health","title":"yc seed metadata","text_snippet":"AI-Native Med-Legal Firm\nIndustries: Healthcare\nBatch: Winter 2026\nTeam size (listed): 1\n{\"slug\": \"docura-health\", \"status\": \"Active\", \"team_size\": 3, \"regions\": [\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"], \"all_locations\": \"San Francisco, CA, USA\", \"isHiring\": false, \"top_company\": false, \"objectID\": \"31090\", \"founders_page_fetched\": true}","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:06.005415Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"source":"yc","program":"YC"}},{"id":"ev_02674307b186","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"homepage","url":"https://docurahealth.com","title":"Complete Med-Legal Reports in Minutes, Not Hours","text_snippet":"Complete Med-Legal Reports in Minutes, Not Hours Features Benefits FAQ About Sign in Book a demo Complete Med-Legal Reports in Minutes, Not Hours Upload medical records, generate AI-powered first drafts, and finalize professional IME, QME, and med-legal reports—with accurate impairment ratings built in. Book a demo HIPAA Compliant First Draft in Under 5 Minutes Enterprise Security Backed by Built for IME, QME, and Med-Legal Documentation AI-powered tools designed for med-legal evaluators. Upload records, generate drafts, calculate impairment ratings, and finalize compliant reports—all in one platform. Book a demo AI-Generated First Drafts Upload records and generate a first draft with all sections required for a compliant report. Add your clinical judgment and physical exam findings using our built-in copilot. Intelligent Record Summaries Our AI extracts key findings, treatment history, and prior diagnoses—organized chronologically and linked to source documents. AMA-Compliant Impairment Ratings Automatic calculations based on AMA Guides (5th & 6th Edition). Enter your findings, get accurate whole person impairment ratings. Report Templates for Every Case Type QME, IME, AME, Permanent & Stationary, and Supplemental reports—all pre-formatted for compliance and customizable to your practice style. From Physicians Like You How med-legal evaluators are using Docura to work smarter. Docura Health saves me hours on every report. Instead of reviewing hundreds of pages manually, I get a clear summary with key findings already organized. Pain Medicine Physician Docura is trusted by Med-Legal Physicians and Evaluators Our platform is designed specifically for medical professionals who demand excellence, accuracy, and efficiency in legal reporting. Book a demo Improve Accuracy Consistent impairment ratings based on AMA Guides methodology. Reduce manual errors and ensure compliance. Reports That Hold Up Well-structured documentation with findings linked to evidence. Built to withstand cross-examination. Faster Report Generation Spend less time on documentation and more time on examinations. Generate first drafts in minutes, not hours. HIPAA Compliant — Your data is safe, secure, and fully compliant. Enterprise-grade security with end-to-end encryption. Patient data protected, audit trails maintained, peace of mind included. Get quick answers to common questions Quick answers about features, security, and getting started. Who is Docura designed for? Docura is built for physicians who write IME, QME, AME, and other med-legal reports. It's used by independent evaluators, multi-physician practices, and panel providers. What types of reports can I create? QME, IME, AME, Permanent & Stationary, Supplemental, and narrative medical reports. All templates are customizable to your practice style. How does the AI-generated first draft work? Upload records and generate a first draft with all sections required for a compliant report. Add your clinical judgment and physical exam findings using our built-in copilot. Does Docura replace my clinical judgment? No. Docura handles documentation—organizing records, drafting sections, calculating ratings. You provide the expertise and make all final decisions. How long does it take to generate a report? First drafts are ready within minutes of uploading records. Total time depends on case complexity and your review. How accurate are the impairment ratings? Ratings are calculated based on AMA Guides (5th and 6th Edition) methodology with documented calculations. All ratings should be reviewed before finalizing. How does the record summary feature work? Our AI creates a chronological summary of key findings, diagnoses, and treatments. Each item links back to the source document for easy verification. Is there a limit on record length? Docura handles large record sets—hundreds of pages are processed efficiently. Contact us for specific volume requirements. Is Docura HIPAA compliant? Yes. Docura is fully HIPAA compliant with enterprise-grade security measures to protect patient information. How is my data protected? All data is encrypted in transit and at rest. We maintain strict access controls, audit logs, and follow best practices for handling protected health information. Is patient data used to train AI models? No. Patient data is used only to generate your reports. It is never used for training or shared with third parties. Got questions? We've got answers. Don't see your question? Reach out to us directly. Contact us Ready to Speed Up Your Reports? See how Docura can fit into your med-legal workflow. Book a 15-minute demo and we'll show you exactly how it works with your case types. Book a demo About us Account Dashboard Trust Center Terms of Service Privacy Policy © 2026 Docura Health. All rights reserved.","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/docurahealth-com/77aee9b93c18da02.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:06.143359Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_69287009154d","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.workable.com/company/tzJ2Win5SoWhhZerQWrMjH/jobs-at-bask-health","title":"Bask Health | Jobs By Workable","text_snippet":"Title: Bask Health | Jobs By Workable\n# **Visit website**. Bask provides a full service software that allows you to build any digital health experience. Built for doctors, physicians, entrepreneurs, and developers, the Bask system was built at enterprise scale for the everyday user. * ### **Senior Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-brazil-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-nicaragua-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-egypt-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-spain-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Back-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-united-states-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Back-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-spain-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Back-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-brazil-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Senior Back-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-argentina-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-cario-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-spain-at-bask-health)**. * ### **Front-End Software Engineer (Remote)-in-brazil-at-bask-health)**.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:15.862038Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Docura Health site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_e03385e1d46c","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://apply.workable.com/health-ipass","title":"Health iPASS","text_snippet":"Title: Health iPASS\nSorry, no job openings at the moment. We open new jobs from time to time, so please check again soon! Health iPASS collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws.If you are a California Job Applicant see the privacy notice for further details. This website uses cookies to improve user’s experience, personalise ads and analyse traffic. You can accept all cookies, decline all optional cookies, or manage your cookie settings. To learn more, view our cookies policy.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:15.862081Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Docura Health site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_bc5e2e500d8a","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://apply.workable.com/ilara-health","title":"Ilara Health - Current Openings","text_snippet":"# Careers at Ilara Health. At Ilara Health, we equip a network of small, peri-urban healthcare providers with life-saving and essential diagnostic tools to improve the quality of medical care across sub-Saharan Africa. As informal businesses, these clinics and pharmacies lack access to the traditional financial services typically used by SMEs to support their growth. Through smart financing options, Ilara Health connects these small businesses to revenue generating diagnostic assets that enable them to both develop their business and improve the quality of care they provide to their patients. Our underlying technology seamlessly integrates these devices into a single user-friendly patient management platform that communicates these test results as well as health insights and patient reminders for better quality care. This platform acts as a provider facing tool that provides clinics with flexible means to improve care outside of the facility through messaging channels and a simple patient portal, while simultaneously giving them the ability to collect and view complete data generated by their diagnostic devices. Ilara Health, a Kenya-based health tech startup has raised $3.75-million in a Series A funding round led by TLcom Capital with contribution from DOB Equity, Global Ventures, and Chandaria Capital. Ilara Health, a Kenya-based health tech startup has received $1.1-million in grant funding from the Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation. Kenya-based diagnostics startup Ilara Health raises $735k. In a nice entrepreneurial space. And have fun and get healthier day by day. ## Sorry, no job openings at the moment. We open new jobs from time to time, so please check again soon!","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:15.862106Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Docura Health site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_c99c201589fd","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://apply.workable.com/our-future-health/j/F41F0B00D9","title":"Health Data Scientist - Our Future Health","text_snippet":"# Health Data Scientist - Our Future Health. # Health Data Scientist. Our Future Health is the UK’s largest ever health research programme, bringing people together to transform the future of healthcare. By bringing together 5 million volunteers from across the UK, Our Future Health is creating one of the most detailed pictures of human health ever assembled. We’re looking for a **Health Data Scientist** to play a pivotal role in unlocking the power of this resource and enabling groundbreaking research at scale. As a Health Data Scientist, you won’t just analyse data; you’ll directly influence how researchers design studies and generate insights that could improve millions of lives. By transforming externally defined research criteria into reliable feasibility analyses and reproducible cohort selection workflows, the Health Data Scientist will ensure that external researchers and research organisations can design robust studies and make informed decisions, grounded in the strengths of the resource. Also by contributing to the development of future feasibility products, such as automated tools and data exploration interfaces, the Health Data Scientist will help shape scalable, efficient systems that support the long-term growth of the programme and unlock greater research value from the resource. * Translate inclusion and exclusion criteria into relevant variables, phenotype definitions, and medical code sets (e.g., SNOMED CT, ICD10, Read) to support consistent feasibility and cohort selection work. * Contribute to the design and development of future, self-service feasibility and data browsing tools and products. * MSc or PhD (or equivalent experience) in **epidemiology, biostatistics, data science, public health**, or a related field. * Wellbeing Support – Access to Mental Health First Aiders, plus 24/7 online GP services and an Employee Assistance Programme for you and your family. _At Our Future Health, we recognise the importance of having a diverse workforce and ensuring that all candidates, regardless of their background, have equitable access to our application process. We proactively encourage applicants who identify as having a disability, neurodiversity, or long-term health conditions to let us know if they require any reasonable adjustments as part of their application process._. Our Future Health collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws.If you are a European Job Applicant see the privacy notice for further details.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:15.862129Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Docura Health site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_cb167b7b1c4a","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://apply.workable.com/eleos-health?lng=en","title":"Eleos Health","text_snippet":"Title: Eleos Health\nWe Care About Doing Good. Eleos Health is powering the future of behavioral health care. Our mission is to empower behavioral health clinicians with voice analysis and NLP technologies to measure and improve the outcomes of talk therapy. Eleos Health understands the nuances of each individual therapy session, powering the future of personalized behavioral health at scale. Sorry, no job openings at the moment. We open new jobs from time to time, so please check again soon! Are we the employer you are looking for? Eleos health is an employer that believes in the importance of behavioral health. People that join our team are mission-driven, talented, and out-of-the-box thinkers. This is an opportunity to join a fast-growing startup slightly before we get \"much, much bigger\". If you are looking to improve the lives of millions of people undergoing life-saving behavioral health treatments while working on a product that brings groundbreaking technology to a fast-paced environment - you have come to the right place! Charles St, Waltham, MA, USA. HaMelacha Street, Tel Aviv-Yafo, Israel. Eleos Health does not discriminate on the basis of race, sex, color, religion, age, national origin, marital status, disability, veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity or any other reason prohibited by law in provision of employment opportunities and benefits. This website uses cookies to improve user’s experience, personalise ads and analyse traffic. You can accept all cookies, decline all optional cookies, or manage your cookie settings. To learn more, view our cookies policy.","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:15.862150Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Docura Health site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_e2aee2dc416a","company_id":"docurahealth-com","source_type":"careers","url":"https://jobs.workable.com/company/tzJ2Win5SoWhhZerQWrMjH/jobs-at-bask-health","title":"Bask Health | Jobs By Workable","text_snippet":"Bask Health | Jobs By Workable","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/docurahealth-com/bb4705c3c5e16a16.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:06:16.072446Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"discovered_via":"search","query_used":