:15 please. Will my checked bag transfer automatically? 5 Agent Agent rebooks and transfers bag rebook_pax(pnr=\"XK73M\", new_flight=\"UA512\") transfer_bag(tag=\"SEA-0042917\") Scenario — Refund Dispute 1 Customer Customer disputes charge I was charged twice for my hotel stay on Jan 5. Confirmation #H-88201. Chat 2 Agent Agent pulls billing records get_billing(conf=\"H-88201\", guest_id=\"G-4419\") 3 Agent Agent confirms duplicate You're right — I see two charges of $189. I'll reverse the duplicate now. issue_refund(txn=\"TXN-90221\", amount=189.00) 4 Customer Customer asks about timeline How long until it shows on my card? 5 Agent Agent provides refund ETA The $189 refund should appear within 3–5 business days. refund_receipt_TXN-90221.pdf File Scenario — Lost Item Claim 1 Customer Customer calls about lost item I left my laptop bag on the plane. Flight DL 847 from ATL to ORD. Audio 2 Agent Agent creates lost item report I'll file a lost item report. Can you describe the bag or send a photo? create_lost_item(flight=\"DL847\", date=\"2026-03-12\") 3 Customer Customer sends photo of item Here's a photo of the same bag from my last trip. Image 4 Agent Agent matches against found items match_item(report=\"LI-3382\", image=true) 5 Agent Agent locates the item shipping_label_LI-3382.pdf File generate_shipping(report=\"LI-3382\", dest=\"customer_address\") Scenario — Flight Rebooking 1 Customer Customer requests rebooking My connecting flight was cancelled. I need to get to Seattle by tonight. Audio 2 Agent Agent searches alternatives search_flights(dest=\"SEA\", date=\"2026-03-12\", after=\"14:00\") 3 Agent Agent offers options I found two options: UA 512 at 4:15 PM or AS 330 at 6:00 PM. Which works? 4 Customer Customer picks earlier flight The 4:15 please. Will my checked bag transfer automatically? 5 Agent Agent rebooks and transfers bag rebook_pax(pnr=\"XK73M\", new_flight=\"UA512\") transfer_bag(tag=\"SEA-0042917\") Scenario — Refund Dispute 1 Customer Customer disputes charge I was charged twice for my hotel stay on Jan 5. Confirmation #H-88201. Chat 2 Agent Agent pulls billing records get_billing(conf=\"H-88201\", guest_id=\"G-4419\") 3 Agent Agent confirms duplicate You're right — I see two charges of $189. I'll reverse the duplicate now. issue_refund(txn=\"TXN-90221\", amount=189.00) 4 Customer Customer asks about timeline How long until it shows on my card? 5 Agent Agent provides refund ETA The $189 refund should appear within 3–5 business days. refund_receipt_TXN-90221.pdf File + toolcall match Lost Item Claim — Results ✓ verified_identity PASS ✓ correct_report_filed PASS ✓ image_match PASS ✗ missing_confirmation FAIL ✓ shipping_generated PASS Flight Rebooking — Results ✓ alternatives_offered PASS ✓ booking_confirmed PASS ✓ bag_transfer PASS ✗ timeout_exceeded FAIL ✓ polite_tone PASS Refund Dispute — Results ✓ duplicate_detected PASS ✓ correct_refund_amount PASS ✓ receipt_generated PASS ✗ incomplete_summary FAIL ✓ compliance_check PASS Lost Item Claim — Results ✓ verified_identity PASS ✓ correct_report_filed PASS ✓ image_match PASS ✗ missing_confirmation FAIL ✓ shipping_generated PASS Flight Rebooking — Results ✓ alternatives_offered PASS ✓ booking_confirmed PASS ✓ bag_transfer PASS ✗ timeout_exceeded FAIL ✓ polite_tone PASS Refund Dispute — Results ✓ duplicate_detected PASS ✓ correct_refund_amount PASS ✓ receipt_generated PASS ✗ incomplete_summary FAIL ✓ compliance_check PASS Backed by Evals for Agents That Actually Work Test agents with real environments. Run evals, catch regressions, fix failures — before your users find them. Get Started Read the Docs Running evals for AI teams at Human Behavior Pax Historia SkillSync Novoflow Human Behavior Pax Historia SkillSync Novoflow New Post Why's This Shit Broken? Our pivot story and why AI testing infrastructure is fundamentally broken. Read → EVAL #208 · scheduling-assistant-v2 User \"Hi, Hazel Tapales — DOB March 14, '79. Need a follow-up.\" \"Got you. Last visit Feb 18. Open slots are 9:30 and 11:00.\" ✓ \"9:30 works.\" \"Booked — today at 9:30. Confirmation sent.\" ✓ Look up patient Hazel Tapales ✓ Book appointment 9:30 AM today ✓ Agent Agent · controlling OpenEMR · demo.openemr.io ‹ › ↻ https:// demo.openemr.io /openemr/interface/main/finder/patient_select.php https:// demo.openemr.io /openemr/interface/main/calendar?pid=84321 https:// demo.openemr.io /openemr/interface/main/calendar?booked=4828 9:30 ~ Tapales,Hazel ✓ Appointment booked · 9:30 AM PASS navigation 4 / 4 steps · 2.1s EVAL #614 · loan-underwriting-v4 Can you review my application for a loan? PDF bank-statement-q4.pdf Redact PII bank-statement-q4.pdf 198ms ✓ Run underwriting profile #2840 1.6s ✓ Pre-approved up to $45,000 at 6.4% APR. DTI 31%, 18 months stable income. ✓ PASS PII redacted · model audit verified Robotics Eval ashr understands your system and proactively tests what's most likely to fail. 01 / DATASETS Every eval your agent has run. Status, traces, scores — all in one place. Click into any run to see exactly what your agent did and where it failed. 02 / TEST DETAILS Full test timelines. Every speaker, every tool call, every response — laid out in order. Replay the conversation and see where the agent went off-script. 03 / EXPLORE Expected vs. actual, side by side. Diff what the agent should have done against what it did. Pinpoint the failure mode at a glance. 04 / PROMPTS Version every prompt. Inline diffs and pass rates per version. Know exactly which edit broke production. 05 / SDK Plug in our SDK. Drop in Python or TypeScript and run evals from your code. Ship fast, ship tested. 01 Datasets 02 Test details 03 Explore 04 Prompts 05 SDK Recent runs all envs last 7 days booking-flow-v2 #482 prod 86.7% 3.2s 2m ago Passed 13 / 15 Tool calls 47 Avg score 0.87 Regressions 2 new cancellation-refund #481 prod 42.1% 5.8s 11m ago flight-search-edge #479 staging 100% 2.1s 38m ago seat-upgrade-logic #476 prod 93.3% 4.4s 1h ago multi-city-booking #473 dev 71.4% 7.0s 3h ago payment-processing #469 staging 58.0% 6.2s 5h ago Conversation trace #482 · cancellation-refund 1 mismatch PDF boarding-pass.pdf 128 KB Hey, can you cancel this flight for me? voice · 3.4s EC {} parse_attachment (file=\"boarding-pass.pdf\") 312ms · 200 AI Got it — booking BK-1492 , SFO → JFK at 8:20 AM tomorrow. You're inside the 24-hour window so a full $342 refund is available. Want me to cancel? voice · 5.1s Yes, please go ahead. voice · 1.8s EC ! cancel_booking (id=\"BK-1492\") expected confirm_cancel AI Done — flight AA1492 has been cancelled. voice · 2.0s #482 · action 4 of 5 Cancellation step mismatch 41% match Expected ✓ confirm_cancel ( booking_id : \"BK-1492\" , refund : true , reason : \"24h_window\" ) → refund $342.00 issued policy applied: 24-hour window Actual ! cancel_booking ( booking_id : \"BK-1492\" refund : true reason : \"24h_window\" ) → cancelled, no refund policy not applied Diagnosis Agent called cancel_booking instead of confirm_cancel — the refund step never ran. Customer was","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/ashr-io/82ade1d61402644c.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:04.273166Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_b32dc74d7741","company_id":"ashr-io","source_type":"search_result","url":"https://jobs.workable.com/view/fMftZMZTuug7x7mroNo1GF/director-of-nursing---school-nursing-services-in-new-york-at-greenlife-healthcare-staffing","title":"Director of Nursing - School Nursing Services | Greenlife Healthcare ...","text_snippet":"Ensure all clinical supervisors and trainers maintain active NYS RN license and registration and strong proficiency with OSH systems (ASHR, SESIS successor","raw_cache_path":null,"fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:15.136818Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{"query_used":"Ashr site:workable.com","search_provider":"tavily"}},{"id":"ev_ff570bc18331","company_id":"ashr-io","source_type":"docs","url":"https://ashr.io/docs/python-sdk/overview/","title":"Ashr Labs Python SDK | Ashr","text_snippet":"Ashr Labs Python SDK | Ashr Skip to main content ashr Home Docs Blog Book a Call Login Python SDK Ashr Labs Python SDK Installation Quick Start Guide Testing Your Agent Authentication VM Integration Guide Voice Observability API Reference Error Handling Examples TypeScript SDK Python SDK Ashr Labs Python SDK On this page Ashr Labs Python SDK A Python SDK for the Ashr Labs platform. Two independent products share this SDK and one API key: Testing Platform — generate datasets, run your agent against test scenarios offline, compare expected vs actual behavior, and submit graded results. The EvalRunner / RunBuilder / Agent / comparators surface. Observability (separate product) — trace your agent's production behavior (LLM calls, tool invocations, retrieval steps, latency, errors). The client.trace() / Span / Generation surface. Traces are stored in Postgres and rendered in the Observability panel of the Ashr Labs dashboard. Requires the observability feature flag for your tenant. Zero external dependencies — pure Python stdlib. Quick Links ​ Testing Your Agent — start here if you're doing offline evals (end-to-end guide with EvalRunner, debugging failures) Observability — Production Agent Tracing — client.trace() , spans, generations, analytics VM Integration — browser/desktop agents with VM stream logging Installation Quick Start Authentication API Reference — EvalRunner, Agent, comparators, RunBuilder, client methods, observability methods SDK Notes — platform advisories delivered to your SDK Error Handling Examples — testing platform examples + observability examples (full agent trace, error tracking, analytics dashboard) Requirements ​ Python 3.10 or higher No external dependencies required Installation ​ pip install ashr-labs Quick Example ​ Any agent with respond() and reset() methods works out of the box: from ashr_labs import AshrLabsClient , EvalRunner client = AshrLabsClient ( api_key = \"tp_your_api_key_here\" ) runner = EvalRunner . from_dataset ( client , dataset_id = 322 ) runner . run_and_deploy ( my_agent , client , dataset_id = 322 ) Or with more control: from ashr_labs import AshrLabsClient , EvalRunner client = AshrLabsClient ( api_key = \"tp_your_api_key_here\" ) # Generate a dataset dataset_id , source = client . generate_dataset ( request_name = \"My Agent Eval\" , config = { . . . } , # Your agent config ) # Run the eval with progress logging runner = EvalRunner ( source ) run = runner . run ( my_agent , on_scenario = lambda sid , s : print ( f\"Running: { s [ 'title' ] } \" ) ) # Submit and wait for server-side grading created = run . deploy ( client , dataset_id = dataset_id ) graded = client . poll_run ( created [ \"id\" ] ) metrics = graded [ \"result\" ] [ \"aggregate_metrics\" ] print ( f\"Passed: { metrics [ 'tests_passed' ] } / { metrics [ 'total_tests' ] } \" ) Support ​ For issues and feature requests, reach out at support@ashr.io or book a call . Next Installation Quick Links Requirements Installation Quick Example Support","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/ashr-io/d32e90384ea332bd.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:15.770543Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}},{"id":"ev_1689ef05c9ba","company_id":"ashr-io","source_type":"blog","url":"https://ashr.io/blog/","title":"Blog | Ashr","text_snippet":"Blog | Ashr Skip to main content ashr Home Docs Blog Book a Call Login Blog Insights on AI agent testing, evals, and building reliable AI systems. Engineering Apr 13, 2026 Building Ash: A Background Coding Agent That Fixes AI Agents How we built Ash, a background coding agent that autonomously detects and fixes issues in AI agent systems. Read more → Founders Feb 4, 2026 Why's This Shit Broken? If you were a fly in our Dogpatch apartment during the late weeks of December, you would hear my cofounder and I barking the same sentence back and forth to each other. \"Why's this shit broken?\" Read more →","raw_cache_path":"/Users/veer/Documents/StartUp/customer_discovery/data/raw/research/ashr-io/a32e4361e6614138.html","fetched_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:16.301447Z","success":true,"error":null,"metadata":{}}],"coverage":{"homepage_found":true,"careers_found":false,"docs_found":true,"status_found":false,"blog_or_changelog_found":true,"github_found":false,"seed_metadata_found":true,"fallback_search_used":true,"total_successful_sources":5,"source_diversity_score":0.5,"confidence_cap":"high"},"trace":{"probes_attempted":["seed_metadata","homepage","known_links","careers","docs","status","blog_changelog","github","agent_search_fallback"],"urls_attempted":["https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/ashr","https://ashr.io","https://jobs.workable.com/view/fMftZMZTuug7x7mroNo1GF/director-of-nursing---school-nursing-services-in-new-york-at-greenlife-healthcare-staffing","https://ashr.io/docs/python-sdk/overview/","https://ashr.io/blog/"],"failures":[],"cache_hits":0,"tool_calls":11}}
